        "text": "<thinking> To create the `security_client.py` file, I need to include the necessary imports for the AWS SDK (Boto3) to interact with AWS Key Management Service (KMS). The file will define a class that provides methods for configuring the client and performing basic operations like encrypting and decrypting data using AWS KMS. </thinking>\n",
